    "RUNG FOUND AT: 1, mitigatable (caught only by building the emitted crate). CEILING: 3, structurally guaranteed: one meaning for `append`, the roster's, and the seed refusing a list argument where the roster declares ReceiverElement. NEXT TRIGGER (can climb now, unbuilt): the seed's append evaluation refuses a non-element argument, after the census above is dispositioned. v1 is semantics-frozen (DESIGN section 3), so the seed side needs a v1_maintenance_standing admission under the PURPOSE test (it serves the v2 self-host program); otherwise the v2 route refuses and the seed stays the oracle that admits it.",
